<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S&amp;P assigns AAA rating to latest RAMS issue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S&amp;P assigns AAA rating to latest RAMS issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Monday it assigned a AAA rating to RAMS Mortgage Corp's A$190 million series 2 class A senior bonds.</p>
<p>S&amp;P also said it assigned a AA minus rating to RAMS' A$10 million series 2 class B subordinate bonds.</p>
<p>The ratings agency said it affirmed the AAA rating previously assigned to RAMS' A$360 million series 1 and A$570 million series 2 senior bonds, and the AA minus rating of RAMS' A$40 million series 1 and A$30 million series 2 subordinated bonds.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
